import ../../site/programs/commands.dl
import site_fixture.dl

set invocations to 0
set destination to ""

function record website command {a pointer to UI instance:instance}:
    globals:
        invocations
        destination
    execute:
        increment invocations
        set destination to instance's event target's destination

set instance to an instance of website fixture
set view to a new UI view
set view's instance to the address of instance
set view's active to true
set state to a new website state
set state's view to the address of view
set instance's state to (the address of state) as a pointer
prepare website fixture editors in (the address of state)
show page "/index.html" in (the address of instance)
bind website program commands in (the address of state)
for each description in (the website program descriptions):
    set target to the control labeled (description's run control) in (the address of instance)
    bind target in (the address of instance) to (the function named "record website command $") for event 0

set source to the UI layout for element (the control labeled "Studio source" in (the address of instance)) in (view's layout)
activate UI layout source in (the address of view)
set view's input kind to 3
set view's key press to 257
set view's modifiers to 2
require condition (process UI key bindings in (the address of view)) reporting "Studio did not bind Control+Enter through shared key dispatch."
require condition ((invocations = 1) and (destination = "action:run-studio")) reporting "Studio activated a different program."
set view's key press to 257
set view's modifiers to 8
require condition (process UI key bindings in (the address of view)) reporting "Studio did not bind Command+Enter."
require condition (invocations = 2) reporting "The shared command did not activate its Run control."
set target to the control labeled "Run studio sketch ▶" in (the address of instance)
set UI control target enabled false in (the address of instance)
set view's key press to 257
require condition (process UI key bindings in (the address of view)) reporting "A disabled Run command leaked its shortcut."
require condition (invocations = 2) reporting "A command activated a disabled Run control."
set view's key press to 257
set view's modifiers to 3
require condition ((process UI key bindings in (the address of view)) = false) reporting "An unbound modifier combination ran a program."
show page "/ide/index.html" in (the address of instance)
set the value of "IDE modes" in (the address of instance) to 1
set source to the UI layout for element (the control labeled "Shader source" in (the address of instance)) in (view's layout)
activate UI layout source in (the address of view)
set view's key press to 257
set view's modifiers to 2
require condition (process UI key bindings in (the address of view)) reporting "An editor in a tab did not receive the shared Run command."
require condition ((invocations = 3) and (destination = "action:run-ide")) reporting "The shader editor used another pane's program."
release website fixture editors in (the address of state)
close the address of instance
print line "Website Run shortcuts use shared scoped commands, the matching control and its enabled policy."
